Let's expand the powers for $\greenD{7^{8}}=\blueD{7^{8}}\cdot\purpleD{7^x}$.

$\begin{align}
&=\blueD{\underbrace{7\cdot7\cdot7\cdot7\cdot7\cdot7\cdot7\cdot7}_\text{8 times}}\cdot\purpleD{\underbrace{    }_{x\text{ times}}}
\\\\\\
&=\greenD{\underbrace{7\cdot 7\cdot 7\cdot 7\cdot 7 \cdot 7 \cdot7 \cdot7}_\text{8 times}}
\\\\
\end{align}$
